["māyāpuṃśaktibhyo nādo'nyo dṛśyate dhvanibhyo'pi", "ityarthaḥ", "aparasparopakārādaviśiṣṭā nārthavācakā yuktāḥ", "na gakāraukāravisarjanīyabāhyaṃ yato'nyadatrāsti", "prāptādvisarjanīyāt khurakambalalakṣaṇā na cidvyaktiḥ", "ityādāvapi syāditi bhāvaḥ", "iṣṭaiva vācyabuddhiraviśiṣṭād yā na saṃbhavati", "vijñānahetavaḥ syurna tato'rthe dhīḥ prakalpyate yena", "vācakamiṣṭamaduṣṭaṃ hetuścet sthūlaśabdajātasya", "vijñānaṃ krameṇa vāsya gavāderarthasyāduṣṭamabhidhāyakamiṣyatāmiti", "tadvastu niravaśeṣamaviśeṣeṇaiva buddhyupārohi", "bāhyākāraviśeṣeṇa buddhyupārūḍhaṃ yataḥ", "asya vimṛśyā vācyā bhedābhedairidaṃ ca sat kintu", "viśeṣaḥ | atrocyate- idaṃ ca sat kintviti", "so'ntaḥsaṃjalpātmā nādaḥ siddho na viṣayabhāvena", "nādastasyā'pi vācyabuddhiṃ janayatīti vakṣyati kārikopasaṃhāre", "dṛṣṭaṃ sadapyasat tad yasmādetena sadā parāmṛṣṭam", "nādābhivyañjakatvenopacārādityadoṣaḥ", "tatkāryaśarīrendriyavikṛteḥ pṛthagevamavyaktam", "guṇakāraṇatvenaiva siddheḥ, kāryāntarahetutve ca pramāṇābhāvāditi", "vākyapade pravibhinnaḥ padārthabuddherasaṅkaro yasmāt", "vācakatvena sthūlaśabdavācya iti", "bālairbhinnā nādā utpattyapavargayoginastena", "utpattivināśadharmitvaṃ kāryatvameṣāṃ siddhamityarthaḥ", "tatsiddho nādaḥ paraḥ sumaṅgalā mālinī mahāmāyā", "vidyākhyaṃ tattvamityuktaṃ taistaistadāgameṣvittham", "iha punaranyaivoktā puruṣāsamavāyinī vāg yasmāt", "yuktam, pariṇāmitvaprasaṅgāt; tasmānnaiveyamatroktā", "bahudhā sthātuṃ yadvā caitanyavinākṛtau vikāritvāt", "tasmāt pratipuruṣāttacchakteśca bhinnākuṇḍalinī nādakāraṇaṃ siddheti", "acidapi śuddhatvānmāyāto'pyanyā tadūrdhvagā kathitā", "yaduktam - māyopari mahāmāyā (rau0 saṃ0 4|28) iti", "adhvanyuktaṃ cānyaiḥ sadāgamaiḥ śreyase ca taddhetuḥ", "siddhirmuktiśca parā nādajñānakriyā ca saphaleti", "kathayantīti pūrvakriyānuṣaṅgaḥ", "tatkāryamabhiṣvaṅgād dṛkkriyayormīlanācca bhinnaṃ yat", "tattvaparikalpanābhāvaprasaṅgācca", "yena sthūlaṃ śabdaṃ mantraṃ tantrātmakaṃ pravartate vāpi", "sthūlasya tu tadabhivyañjakatvād vācakatvamityuktam", "vācakajātaṃ nirmāyāntaratastad vyanakti bāhye'pi", "vācyavibhinnāṃ buddhiṃ kurvanto vardhayanti janayātrām", "nārāyaṇakaṇṭhasutaḥ kāśmīre vṛttapañcaviṃśatyā"]